WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,520
No bad things are good, no gambling or whoring, no talking about drinking, no

2
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:04,880
Housework doesn’t have to be too high

3
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:06,800
But if you have a good temper, you can't control me too much

4
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:07,720
I can buy whatever I want

5
00:00:07,720 --> 00:00:11,300
I don't care about people

6
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:12,760
That's all

7
00:00:12,760 --> 00:00:14,080
you don't mind my legs

8
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:15,480
My legs

9
00:00:15,480 --> 00:00:17,190
Maybe it will never get better in this life

10
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:19,550
It’s hopeless to try, and there’s no future

11
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:20,510
don't mind

12
00:00:20,510 --> 00:00:21,630
At worst, I'll take a look at it

13
00:00:21,630 --> 00:00:22,790
Poor little

14
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:23,870
Looks so good-looking

15
00:00:23,870 --> 00:00:25,870
I can't run very far with my legs intact, and you don't care how much money I spend

16
00:00:25,870 --> 00:00:27,470
What a wonderful thing this is

17
00:00:27,470 --> 00:00:30,420
Then... steal the pot back to the business

18
00:00:30,420 --> 00:00:34,740
Then why don't I go tell anyone?

19
00:00:37,720 --> 00:00:39,870
I'll understand the rest

20
00:00:39,870 --> 00:00:42,190
The rest is for you in the south to worry about.

21
00:00:42,190 --> 00:00:45,100
Xu... Xu Zhi

22
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:47,020
I said, why didn’t I see you in the house today?

23
00:00:47,020 --> 00:00:50,180
It turns out that I was tired after hiding out.

24
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:51,100
Gone back

25
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:53,060
Then I'll send you down without any need.

26
00:00:53,060 --> 00:00:54,820
The gentle mask of a previous life

27
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:55,900
I've brought enough

28
00:00:55,900 --> 00:00:58,020
Now, because of my anxious legs, my temperament has changed drastically.

29
00:00:58,020 --> 00:00:59,540
Saved a lot of trouble

30
00:00:59,540 --> 00:01:01,900
Go to Baobaozhai to buy some exquisite snacks

31
00:01:01,900 --> 00:01:03,980
Send it to Miss Song in the box on the second floor

32
00:01:03,980 --> 00:01:05,630
This is me

33
00:01:05,630 --> 00:01:06,830
Have a favorite name

34
00:01:18,310 --> 00:01:20,780
People are coming

35
00:01:20,820 --> 00:01:22,980
Mother, why did you come back?

36
00:01:22,980 --> 00:01:24,540
I just met Mr. Xu

37
00:01:24,540 --> 00:01:25,880
Just you two

38
00:01:25,880 --> 00:01:27,040
This lonely man and woman

39
00:01:27,040 --> 00:01:28,520
If word spreads, do you still want your reputation?

40
00:01:28,520 --> 00:01:29,520
She didn't do anything to you, right?
